{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_03_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:58e91dcdcec6ba4f758d31b67e7b46ff975d47d9b34a7bd0284319e4c5c42c0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a773f0afb2dec2a756d7f806ba50e24ff13f113c1c51b6b575bf2a24cbc08787",
      "text": "玄武家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b82b1dd59d58f475d949d242ab5fe372cd4d1fb1081e781c066211f07332e9f",
      "text": "（有言实行。就像对相棒说的那样，\n我一定会通过偶像试镜给他们看）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae715aac7c0c733ae5ca5e844bb7c9be349ca5f344fe3f286bdb66e971a6b14",
      "text": "好大的场地啊。\n……坐在最后面的家伙能看得清吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9231754e64a3e151dfa97cea39620c2bab1e23443c36f5d1eb35179cf2873ddd",
      "text": "（……好华丽的登场。服装也相当显眼。\n听到欢呼声了。到底有多厉害？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb58c8b70f40135047a33f6a081ef859f9e034e02d7a31487cf6e34c4e66c3c6",
      "text": "（粉丝配合歌曲的呼喊和动作都整齐划一）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92dace0c31f588384f9afc862b06607e8594a718fbca0e97ae1bd610345f82f7",
      "text": "（这些偶像，\n统率着这么庞大数量的粉丝吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff87a42d808b10ba57f7dba68a9a540d0e90eb7d0d4f465f00953c41ba954e2e",
      "text": "（离得那么近居然放烟花和火焰！？\n粉丝居然也不害怕……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03aed6758d11e5885277204d56ab98bbb618a8651a0091cf26675975114b8ce1",
      "text": "（不管是偶像还是粉丝，胆子都够大的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd2cf3dc5b8c50fe0b42b16f64df60e344a5e92eca54f940eb56de0ab739c675",
      "text": "所谓的偶像，是远远超出我想象的\n了不得的存在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2761c9b5c8db564a421f1092141880a22fa68f5925a6ce7d54ea351903b4049",
      "text": "最后一排的大家也请接好哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aade5b372e737d1c72b5ea23ef14473e0984109685f6c9c6010db894eba81b1",
      "text": "刚才的飞吻，好像连最后一排都传达到了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd045973b47c7defc524df7c0c2e48cd694668d97440e495607b1d5b49b976fe",
      "text": "（虽然隐约能猜到，\n但偶像还真是个轻浮的职业啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c0f392d8dc01f8a21adac45471c196e2aa99851e7f25b0332f54cfd500ff7a",
      "text": "……不，仅凭这个下判断还为时尚早。\n结论等全部看完再下也不迟。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
